Standard system for all tasks:
    L = 6 ring, Ne = 6 (half-filling), t = 1.0, U = 10.0  (t/U = 0.1),
    uniform PBC, GCG convex-roof solver, n = 2..6.

Every task can be run in TWO Hilbert-space modes:
    • DEFAULT           → Sz = 0 sector only   (n_up = n_down = Ne/2)
    • --full-hamiltonian → complete Ne-electron space (all Sz sectors)

The four tasks:
    TASK 1  Thermal GME vs Temperature         C_GME(n, T)
    TASK 2  3D surface (Temperature × t/U)      C_GME(n; t/U, T)
    TASK 3  t-scan vs t/U   (T = 0)             C_GME(n, t/U)
    TASK 4  U-scan vs U/t   (T = 0)             C_GME(n, U/t)


